<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/eng@/~cl_10> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 14 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) Notwithstanding paragraph (1)(c), where the person summoned is a person detained at a place of detention under any written law, or is being placed at any institution or other place, such summons shall be issued in accordance with written laws or guidelines, as the case may be, applicable to such place of detention, institution or place.”. Substitution of section 22"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/eng@> .
