<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/eng@/~cl_3__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsections: “(3a) The members of the Commission appointed under this section shall consist of at least one representative from amongst persons with disabilities and at least thirty per cent of representatives from amongst women. (3b) Any person who is actively involved in politics and registered with any political party shall not be appointed as a member of the Commission.”. New section 6a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/eng@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/eng@> .
