<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/eng@/~cl_9> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 13 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(3) Where the Commission has referred any infringement of human rights to the relevant authority or person under subsection (2), the relevant authority or person shall inform the Commission of any action taken by the relevant authority or person in relation to the infringement of human rights.”. Amendment of section 14"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/eng@> .
